{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 341, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0aff7d1f0b0f8b1f263f0b2f14881432f2ff18ef263f8a3f0aaf0abf8acf247f2822f2ff0a6f8b2f1cff0f081b8", "baseline_text": "있잖아…칸나 말이야，//정말로 스미레 씨랑//사이 좋네∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねぇ……カンナってさ、//ホントにすみれさんと//仲がいいよね！", "pointer_offset": 284, "unit": "dialogue:e02d5bc604bf4b01", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 402, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0b1f7d1f0aaf0abf8acf247fa82f0b0f0b1f0e72f2ff1acf984f154f0a2f1c7f7d1", "baseline_text": "나…스미레 씨랑 칸나를//보고 있으면…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ボク……すみれさんとカンナを//見てると……", "pointer_offset": 288, "unit": "dialogue:5d24e88fe9b7d159", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 445, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f147f19ef0aaf0b9f947f0e381432f2ff0dcf0acf0b5f174f0d2f0a8f9d7f0eff167f0b6f0e72f2ff1f2f2baf0aef957f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "서커스에서 본，//클레오파트라와 요키히를//떠올리는 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "サーカスにいる、//クレオパトラとヨーキヒを//思い出すんだ。", "pointer_offset": 292, "unit": "dialogue:1b7c6b9984740838", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 504, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0d88143f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d12f2ff169f7d1f0dcf0acf0b5f174f0d2f0a8f0a8f18481432f2ff1cefaaaf184f27cf0a8f39ff0a4f7d1", "baseline_text": "그，그렇구나…//크…클레오파트라라고，//분명 고릴라였지…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そ、そうかい……//ク……クレオパトラって、//確か、ゴリラだったよな……", "pointer_offset": 296, "unit": "dialogue:624604fc625db1a6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 575, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0eff167f0b6f1578143f147f19ef0aaf8b9f154f1572f2ff2f9f0cff0d3f18df7d12f2ff18efa63f0eef964f154f957f0aff0b2f14881b8", "baseline_text": "요키히는，서커스에 있는//판다인데…//정말 품격 있는 아이야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ヨーキヒは、サーカスにいる//パンダでね……//すごい上品な子なんだよ！", "pointer_offset": 300, "unit": "dialogue:f6ed261c4ae21923", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 644, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f1f6fa6af1bdf1adf14ff9d4f0ccf0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff0e4f1aef1d9f957f299f3d5f2caf1f5f0b92f2ff991f1acf0b2f1c8f2c08144", "baseline_text": "항상 싸우기만 했지만…//장난치는 것처럼밖에//안 보이거든．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いっつもケンカしてたけど……//じゃれあってるようにしか//見えないんだよね。", "pointer_offset": 304, "unit": "dialogue:c6f3144df002b884", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 719, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f2e8f8a4f263f0b2f148f7d12f2ff271f0f9f944f3e9f8c8f94af154f1572f2ff1bdf25ef0b2f1f3f15a8144", "baseline_text": "왠지 말이야…//모두가 웃을 수 있는//싸움이었어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なんだかさ……//みんなが笑顔になるような//ケンカだったんだ。", "pointer_offset": 308, "unit": "dialogue:3942e1145a889c56", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 780, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f1bdf25ef0a2f8a3f271f0f9f1442f2ff3e9f8f1f243f957f28af144f7d1", "baseline_text": "싸움으로 모두가//웃게 되는 건가…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ケンカでみんなが//笑顔になるか……", "pointer_offset": 312, "unit": "dialogue:5366a5eb0767872b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 815, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f24cf24df0b6f7d12f2ff0d8fa62f1c7f0f481432f2ff154f0c8f0a4f8f4f271f272f29ef0f08144", "baseline_text": "응，확실히…//그런 면도，//있을지도 모르겠네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、確かに……//そういうところも、//あるかもな。", "pointer_offset": 316, "unit": "dialogue:fff79c4c5780ff19", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 866, "capacity": 72, "raw_hex": "f0d8f2ca8143f25af96bf0b5f943f0b2f148f14ff0a5f0cff0c12f2ff0b2f1d9f0a3f1a9faaff254f98bf2aff0b8f261f7d12f2ff38efb8ef1f7f2d6f8a3f0d0f0aff2ecf0f181b8", "baseline_text": "그럼，너무 오래 이야기하다간//이치로한테 혼날 테니까…//슬슬 전투로 돌아갈게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "じゃ、あんまり話ししてると//イチローに怒られるから……//そろそろ、戦闘にもどるね！", "pointer_offset": 320, "unit": "dialogue:3f0f39654d35a389", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 949, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f0aff0aff7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0b1f140f8b9f34981b8", "baseline_text": "아，아아…//그럼，나중에 봐∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ、ああ……//じゃ、また後でな！", "pointer_offset": 324, "unit": "dialogue:8f7942213c4d9fd4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 982, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f7d1faccf273f274f8f3f0b2f148f14ff0e72f2ff1daf1f3f0a4f1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "…꽤 괜찮은 이야기를//들었지만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……なかなかイイ話を//聞かせてもらったけど……", "pointer_offset": 328, "unit": "dialogue:2dddea1bf6f54264", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 1029, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f2f98143f2f9f0cff0d3f144f7d12f2ff0b2fa8af25af96bf3e9f2c6f14781432f2ff0aaf0abf0acf1a9f2aff957fa81f1daf1b2f1e2f29ef0a98144", "baseline_text": "판，판다인가…//이건 너무 웃겨서，//스미레한테는 못 들려주겠군．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "パ、パンダか……//こいつは面白すぎて、//すみれには聞かせられねぇな。", "pointer_offset": 332, "unit": "dialogue:6771d653c43f9f33", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04027.SBN", "offset": 1098, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 336, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
